          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Cooperative and maintains eye contact; somewhat tense and demanding at times. Speech normal in volume and rate, slightly pressured when discussing work and medication. Affect congruent and tearful, reactive. Thought form logical and goal directed. Thought content preoccupied with father's death and guilt; no delusions or hallucinations. Cognition grossly intact and oriented to person, place, and time."
